<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<info xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://apps.nextcloud.com/schema/apps/info.xsd">
    <id>estadistica</id>
    <name>Estadística</name>
    <summary>Cifras REM del establecimiento junto al promedio nacional y de pares, y el avance de las Metas Sanitarias</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Las cifras REM que el DEIS publica para todo el país, etiquetadas con su diccionario oficial, para comparar el establecimiento con el promedio nacional y con establecimientos parecidos; y el avance mes a mes de las Metas Sanitarias de Atención Primaria. Consultable por todo el personal.

No contiene información de pacientes: guarda solo conteos agregados publicados por el DEIS y FONASA.]]></description>
    <version>0.0.8</version>
    <licence>AGPL-3.0-or-later</licence>
    <author>Daniel Espinoza</author>
    <namespace>Estadistica</namespace>
    <category>tools</category>
    <dependencies>
        <php min-version="8.2" max-version="8.5"/>
        <!-- PostgreSQL only, by construction (docs/adr/0002): the loader binds
             PostgreSQL arrays to unnest(), and every consulta runs inside
             SET TRANSACTION READ ONLY + SET LOCAL statement_timeout. Declaring
             it refuses the install on another engine at enable time, instead
             of at the first consulta, and turns off the Oracle naming checks
             (MigrationService::__construct). The attribute is load-bearing:
             without one, InfoParser hands MigrationService the bare string
             "pgsql" and its foreach over it warns on every migration run;
             with one it is the {@attributes, @value} array both
             MigrationService and DependencyAnalyzer expect (measured on the
             nextcloud:34 image, 2026-09-28). 18 is the suite's PostgreSQL. -->
        <database min-version="18">pgsql</database>
        <nextcloud min-version="34" max-version="34"/>
    </dependencies>
    <!-- The app's only scheduled work, registered by Nextcloud's own cron:
         nothing on the host's scheduler (acceptance a18, docs/adr/0004). -->
    <background-jobs>
        <job>OCA\Estadistica\BackgroundJob\RemJob</job>
    </background-jobs>
    <!-- The section is IDelegatedSettings: an admin hands it to any group with
         occ admin-delegation:add or Administration privileges; no group name
         lives in this app (docs/adr/0003). -->
    <settings>
        <admin>OCA\Estadistica\Settings\AdminSettings</admin>
        <admin-section>OCA\Estadistica\Settings\AdminSection</admin-section>
    </settings>
    <navigations>
        <navigation>
            <name>Estadística</name>
            <route>estadistica.page.index</route>
        </navigation>
    </navigations>
</info>
